<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">Habakuka</book>
  <para style="h">Habakuka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakuka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuka</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakuka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Inlârnaa zâwlnei Habakuka thil hmuh chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , min pui tûrin ka auh che hi, Eng chen nge, min ngawihsan dâwn? ‘Mi sualten mi vaw hlum takngial dâwn,’ tia ka auh che pawhin, Engati nge min chhân loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engati nge dik lo taka thil an tih min hmuhtîra, Râwng taka an che i ngaihtheih zêl le? Inrawk leh invuak a hluar a, Inhau leh invelh a tam hle hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dam hian awmzia a nei tawh lo va, Dikna a lal tawh hek lo. Mi sualten mi dikte an dinchan khalh a, Chuvângin, dik taka thil tih a ni ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In vêla hnamte hi thlîr kual ula, En ngun teh u, Mak in ti hle ang, In hriat pawha in awih loh tûr, In hmuh phâkah thil ka tih dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, Kaldai mite chu ka chawk tho dâwn a, Hnam kawlhsen leh thinram tak, Mi ram neihsak tuma ram tina vâkvêl ṭhînte chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hlauhawmin an ṭihbaiawm hle mai, Chapo takin duh duhin an che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An sakawrte pawh keite aiin an chak a, Thimhlim chinghniate ai pawhin an hlauhawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An sakawr chuang mite chu ram hla tak aṭangin Chak takin an lo tlân dur dur a, Mupui âr la tûr bir angin an chak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi rûn tûra lo kal an ni vek a, An thâwm hria apiang an thlabâr a, Ṭiauvaivut anga tam sal an man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalte an palzût a, miliante pawh an nuihzat a, Kulhte lah engah mah an ngai lo, Lei an chhûng pâwng a, an la zêl mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmân ata tawh Pathian thianghlim, nung reng, Lalpa chu i ni lo vem ni? Aw Lalpa , anni chu min hrem tûra i ruat an ni a, Aw kan kulhpui, min thununtu atân i ruat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I mitte chu a thianghlim êm êm a, Thil sual i en reng thei si lo va. Engati nge vervêk taka tite i ngaihtheih viau si? Mi sualten an aia ṭhate an tihduhdah laia Engtizia nge i ngawih reng mai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engtizia nge mihring hi tuipui sangha ang leh Rannung bawkvâka kal lal nei lote ang leka i siam ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaldai-ho chuan mite nghakuaiin an âwk a, Lênin an khuh a, lênkhangin an fûn a, An hlim êm êm lehnghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, an lênte chu chibai an bûk a, An lênkhang hnênah inthawina an hlân a, Ei tûr an hmuhna leh nuam an tâwl theihna a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, an lênte chu tiruak zêlin, Hnamte chu lainat hauh lovin an that zêl dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka vênbûkah ka lâwn ang a, Ka hnêna a sawi tûr nghâkin awmhmun ka rem teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian min chhâng a: “Inlârna thu chu lungphêkah ziak rawh, Tlân pah pawha chhiar theih khawpa chiangin ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He inlârna hi hun bîk nei a ni a, A thlen hun thlîr reng la, a daw lo vang. A muan pawhin nghâk deuh la, A thleng ngei dâwn, a tlai dâwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En teh, mi chapo chuan a sual avângin a tuar ang a, Mi dik erawh chu a rinawm avângin a him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zu hian mi a bum ṭhîn, Mi chapo chu a awm hle hle thei lo va, A duhâmzia chu Seol anga zau a ni, Thihna angin chin lêm a nei lo va, Hnam tin hruai khâwma, Mi zawng zawng la khâwm ṭhîntu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mite chuan tiel leh hmusit takin ‘Rûkrûka intihausa chu a chung a pik e, Mi neih chhuhsakin eng chen nge i intihhausak dâwn le?’ An lo ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I leibatnate chuan an rawn ṭhîng thut ang che a, An rawn timangang hle ang che, An kut i tuar mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam tam tak i rawk a, Mi thisen i chhuah a, ram i suasam a, Khawpui leh a chhûnga chêngte i tiboral a. Chuvângin, a thi bângte chu i chungah an ṭuan ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dik lo taka sum leh pai hai lûta, Mi sual kut tuar hlauva in ṭha pui pui satu chu A chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam tam tak tihral i tum hi, In chhûngkaw mualphona tûr a ni, Nang ngei pawhin i tuar phah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang aṭangin lungten an au khum ang che a, Khanchhukte chuan an lo chhâwn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khaw siam nâna thisen chhuaha, Khawpui din nâna sualna hmangtu chung chu a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kâng ral mai tûr in sa-in mite an thawkrim a, Hnamte pawh thil sâwt lovah an intihah a, Chûng chu Engkim Lalpa ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuifinriat hi tuiin a khat vek angin, Lei pum puiah Lalpa ropuizia an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tihmualpho tuma mahni ṭhiante An ruih hnêp thlenga in tûr petu chu A chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang pawhin i in ve ang a, i mualpho vang, I rui ang a, i pai i pai ang. Mi zahawm chu nuihzatbûr i ni ang a, Lalpa hremna chu i tuar ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ramsa i tihlum a, an ṭi zo va, Mihring thisen i chhuah a, Ramah te, khawpuiah te, a chhûnga chêng chungahte Tharum i thawh a. Chutiang bawkin i chungah an ti ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chher chawp milem hi eng nge a ṭangkaina? Themthiam kutchhuak mai a ni, Eng mah a ni lo, A siamtu chuan ama kutchhuak ngei Milim, ṭawng thei hlei lo chu innghah nân zu hmang ta a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thingtum hnêna, ‘Tho teh,’ ti a, Lungtum, ṭawng thei lo hnêna, ‘Ding teh,’ titu chu A chung a pik e. Rangkachak leh tangkaruaa luan, Nunna nei lo milem chuan a zirtîr ang che maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chu a in thianghlimah a awm a, Lei pum pui hi a hmaah ngawi ṭhiap rawh se.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Fakna hla, Zâwlnei Habakuka ṭawngṭaina:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thâwm ka lo hriatin hlauhawm ka va ti êm! Aw Lalpa , hmâna i thiltihte ang kha han ti leh teh, Kan hun lai ngei hian han ti leh ang che, Thinur hle mah la, min khawngaih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian chu Teman aṭangin a lo kal a, Mi Thianghlima chu Paran tlâng aṭangin. (Selah) A ropuina chu vânah a khat a, Lei hi amah faknain a khat ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ênzia chu ni ang a ni a, A kut aṭangin ni zung a lo chhuak a, Tah chuan a ni a thiltihtheihna a thuhrûk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hripuiin a hma a hruai a, Thihnain a rawn zui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A han ding a, lei a tinghîng a, A hawi vêl a, hnamte an khûr, Tlâng hlunte chu a kehsawm a, A lênna ṭhin mualte pawh chu A pil zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kus mite puan in chhe rem rum chu ka hmu a, Midian-ho chênna pawh a chul zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , luite chuan an tithinrim che em ni? Luipuite leh tuifinriatte chuan an tithinur che em ni? I sakawr, hnehna tawlailîr chunga i chuan tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I thalngul chu i phawrh a, Thalte pawh a hruiah i vuah ta. Luikawr atân lei chu i kâp khi phawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlângte chuan an hmu che a, an hlau va, Tuite an luang darh chum chum a, Tuithûkpui chu a ri hum hum a, Sâng tak takin a invawrh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I thal lêng nuai nuai leh i fei de zawr zawr avângin, Ni leh thla chu an chesawn ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thinurin lei i fang chhuak a, Thinrimin hnamte i chîl ta hrep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I mite chhan tûrin i lo thawk a, I hriak thiha chhan tûrin, Mi suaksualte hotu chu i sawisa a, Ke lêr aṭangin chhîp thlengin a silhfên i hlihsak a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A rûka mi retheite ei zawh nuam titu, Ṭhawngaleivir anga min tihchhiat tuma lo thawk Hotupa chu a feiin i chhun ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I sakawrte nêna tuipui in han dai chuan A phuan ta buah buah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka han hriat chuan tirilah ka khûr a, Ka kha a inkhâwng a, ka thauvah a man a, Ka ke a phet ta a. Min rûntute a rawn hremna ni chu Ngawi rengin ka nghâk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theipui rah lovin grep rah dâwn lo mah se, Oliv pawh rah lovin lovah eng mah thar dâwn lo mah se, Huanga berâm bo zovin, ran in ruak vek mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chungah chuan ka lâwm zêl ang a, Min chhandamtu Pathian chu ka fak zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chu mi tichaktu a ni, Sakhi ke angin ka ke a tichak a, Hmunsâng takah min lêntîr ang.
  </para>
</usx>
